[
    {
        "content": "<p>There has been discussion about having <code>Real.cast</code> in the past: <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"116395\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/116395-maths/topic/reals.20are.20unique.20complete.20ordered.20field/with/131171889\">#maths &gt; reals are unique complete ordered field</a> </p>\n<p>Searching the documentation I do not find any information about this. Are there reasons not to define this function or is it just not useful anywhere? (There is <code>Complex.ofReal</code>; is this the only possible use case?)</p>\n<p>The signature would be something like</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Real</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">RealCast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Real</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 584414164,
        "sender_full_name": "fiforeach",
        "timestamp": 1775730104
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Most of the time when this function exists it is just <code>algebraMap</code></p>",
        "id": 584464219,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1775743969
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1006462\">fiforeach</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Why.20is.20there.20no.20.60Real.2Ecast.60.3F/near/584414164\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>There is <code>Complex.ofReal</code>; is this the only possible use case?)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>There are plenty of types <code>A</code> which satisfy <code>Algebra Real A</code>; real matrices, endomorphisms over real vector spaces, real polynomials, ...</p>",
        "id": 584464564,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1775744051
    }
